{"updated":"2026-10-24T21:18:57.377Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Almost 1,000 arrested as clashes follow another day of mass protests across France. Elsewhere, 'The marches went well' – French government on demonstrations a week after looting and violence. And violent clashes as Albanian government cracks down on protests. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.1 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 3.6 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 74 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.9 near 197 km WNW of Port-Olry, Vanuatu. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.13,0.17,0.22,0.26,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.58,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.09,1.33,1.45,1.5,1.52,1.54,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.66,1.71,1.74,1.82,1.88,1.93,1.96,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.17,2.22,2.26,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.48,2.53,2.59,2.65,2.72,2.83,2.93,3.04,3.06,3.11,3.13,3.19,3.24,3.3,3.39,3.47,3.53,3.59,3.63,3.68,3.71,3.76,3.81,3.83,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.97,4.02,4.06,4.14,4.2,4.26,4.32,4.39,4.46,4.49,4.55,4.57,4.63,4.75,4.9,5.05,5.49,5.61,5.67,5.74,5.79,5.84,5.89,5.96,6.13,6.25,6.46,6.54,6.65,6.71,6.73,6.79,6.84,6.91,6.98,7.05,7.12,7.15,7.21,7.26,7.29,7.36,7.42,7.48,7.56,7.63,7.67,7.77,7.85,8.06,8.13,8.19,8.22,8.27,8.3,8.34,8.39,8.43,8.51,8.57,8.62,8.64,8.67,8.7,8.75,8.8,8.92,8.96,9.02,9.04,9.08,9.16,9.21,9.27,9.32,9.37,9.43,9.47,9.53,9.61,9.7,9.81,9.87,9.94,10.02,10.08,10.17,10.23,10.28,10.31,10.37,10.41,10.47,10.52,10.61,10.73,10.8,10.84,11.02,11.13,11.83,11.95,12.01,12.06,12.11,12.14,12.2,12.24,12.28,12.43,12.48,12.54,12.57,12.62,12.67,12.69,12.75,12.78,12.85,12.91,12.98,13.02,13.1,13.13,13.18,13.21,13.28,13.32,